{"id": "EUVD-2026-103652", "enisaUuid": "74d73580-8771-3891-b1c0-dfdab45e2ce6", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/virtio: fix object leaks in virtio_gpu_resource_create_blob_ioctl()\n\nvirtio_gpu_resource_create_blob_ioctl() calls drm_gem_object_release() on\nboth the virtio_gpu_resource_assign_uuid() and drm_gem_handle_create()\nerror paths instead of dropping the reference it owns, so\nobj->funcs->free() never runs and the virtio_gpu_object, the resource id\nand the host-side resource are leaked.\n\nUse drm_gem_object_put() instead.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:19:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:22:34", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/73ea38a89b923fa08047885a0845d1cd89261ead", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eea473532a286cd1b13cddbec5c645989f43a3aa", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/88c60c06a2a5244f5dd32ec098e633add114890f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0455867bbd95ffa9d9db0a1c6dda500f8126232c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/81c6769e069d703154087377d1749af2f1b74e49", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/02df4e24dc4c0bf5b0425a6acabc5201d7f04fc2", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/24b6d5c7641412c9ebef0d4c8b888d49a0e6b880"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cch7-4w9v-52q8", "CVE-2026-98607"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "08d5b109-d315-3018-b996-6623eee32552", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.189"}, {"id": "093d1113-30b1-3107-af0c-df51333689ef", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "897b4d1acaf56314652c6a8e75d9f86b5e45638d <eea473532a286cd1b13cddbec5c645989f43a3aa"}, {"id": "2e4b5d84-4a06-30e6-9e30-23ee83cd61d9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.112"}, {"id": "30f20458-a9b7-32a9-93b0-c8461848d7b2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "897b4d1acaf56314652c6